m9u23kn8l9HCc7MGIt39y2OHuXw&oe=69EA0632"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ThingLink", "keywords": ["immersive", "learning", "interactive", "training", "thinglink"], "long_description": "ThingLink for Meta Quest serves as your immersive learning solution for annotated content and courses created with ThingLink. Engage with a variety of spatial computing experiences, including immersive courses, annotated images/videos, captivating 360-degree media, and interactive 3D models - allowing you to explore objects, mechanisms, and environments in astonishing detail and from every angle.\n\nThingLink for Meta Quest is a proven tool that deepens understanding and positively impacts learning retention through immersion in a variety of multimodal experiences. Whether used for education, upskilling, employee training, or personal growth - ThingLink for Meta Quest makes it easy to explore the world, learn new concepts, and develop new skills in an innovative and engaging way.", "short_description": "ThingLink for Meta Quest is your immersive learning solution for interactive learning content and training courses. Explore annotated images, videos, 360-degree media, and 3D models. Ideal for education and professional development, it enhances understanding and retention through engaging, multimodal experiences, making learning both innovative and impactful."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.thinglink.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.thinglink.com/terms", "publisher_name": "ThingLink", "support_website_url": "https://support.thinglink.com/", "website_url": "https://www.thinglink.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "intern